From: PengyOS <https://pengyos.catbee.ca>
Subject: [PATCH] ext/libav: do not name the codec IDs ffmpeg 9 removed

gst-libav 1.24.13 lists AV_CODEC_ID_V308, AV_CODEC_ID_V408 and AV_CODEC_ID_V410 in
its "no quasi codecs, please" filter, in both gstavviddec.c and gstavvidenc.c.
ffmpeg 9.0 removed those three IDs (they are present in 6.1.5's libavcodec/codec_id.h
at lines 209/260/261 and absent from 9.0.2's), so the plugin does not compile:

  gstavvidenc.c:1031:26: error: 'AV_CODEC_ID_V308' undeclared (first use in this function)

Checked against gst-libav 1.24.13, 1.26.0 and 1.28.8: all three releases name them,
so no gst-libav version builds against ffmpeg 9 as shipped.

Guarded with `#if LIBAVCODEC_VERSION_MAJOR < 63`, which is the file's own existing
pattern for the same problem (LIBAVCODEC_VERSION_MAJOR < 61 guards AV_CODEC_ID_AYUV
a few lines below). libavcodec is 60 in ffmpeg 6.x, 61/62 in 8.x, 63 in 9.0.

Carried on our own gst1-libav-pengyos recipe (divergence.toml -> ffmpeg-9.0.2-fork):
the recipe is ours, so this is a fix in a recipe we author, not a fix written into
somebody else's package. Effect: the three QuickTime graphics codecs are not offered
by the libav plugin; every other ffmpeg-backed codec gstreamer uses is unaffected.

--- a/ext/libav/gstavviddec.c
+++ b/ext/libav/gstavviddec.c
@@ -2680,9 +2680,12 @@
     if (in_plugin->id == AV_CODEC_ID_RAWVIDEO ||
         in_plugin->id == AV_CODEC_ID_V210 ||
         in_plugin->id == AV_CODEC_ID_V210X ||
+#if LIBAVCODEC_VERSION_MAJOR < 63
         in_plugin->id == AV_CODEC_ID_V308 ||
         in_plugin->id == AV_CODEC_ID_V408 ||
-        in_plugin->id == AV_CODEC_ID_V410 || in_plugin->id == AV_CODEC_ID_R210
+        in_plugin->id == AV_CODEC_ID_V410 ||
+#endif
+        in_plugin->id == AV_CODEC_ID_R210
 #if LIBAVCODEC_VERSION_MAJOR < 61
         || in_plugin->id == AV_CODEC_ID_AYUV
 #endif
--- a/ext/libav/gstavvidenc.c
+++ b/ext/libav/gstavvidenc.c
@@ -1028,9 +1028,12 @@
     if (in_plugin->id == AV_CODEC_ID_RAWVIDEO ||
         in_plugin->id == AV_CODEC_ID_V210 ||
         in_plugin->id == AV_CODEC_ID_V210X ||
+#if LIBAVCODEC_VERSION_MAJOR < 63
         in_plugin->id == AV_CODEC_ID_V308 ||
         in_plugin->id == AV_CODEC_ID_V408 ||
-        in_plugin->id == AV_CODEC_ID_V410 || in_plugin->id == AV_CODEC_ID_R210
+        in_plugin->id == AV_CODEC_ID_V410 ||
+#endif
+        in_plugin->id == AV_CODEC_ID_R210
 #if LIBAVCODEC_VERSION_MAJOR < 61
         || in_plugin->id == AV_CODEC_ID_AYUV
 #endif
